			"notes": "## Highlights\n\n- Display localized item names as the primary label with registry IDs as secondary information across selectors, recipe import, ghost slots, tooltips, and stack previews.\n- Rework Extreme Smithing editing, importing, and inspection to expose five physical inputs: template, base, and three separate additions, plus one output.\n- Preserve legacy workspaces that stored a single addition matcher while using the new three-slot workspace representation.\n- Keep Forge 1.20.1 and NeoForge 1.21.1 behavior synchronized.\n\n## Downloads\n\n- `AvaritiaTweak-forge-1.20.1-1.3.0-release.jar` — Forge 1.20.1\n- `AvaritiaTweak-neoforge-1.21.1-1.3.0-release.jar` — NeoForge 1.21.1\n\n## Validation\n\n- NeoForge 1.21.1: 130 tests, 0 failures; clean build passed.\n- Forge 1.20.1: 122 tests, 0 failures; clean build passed.\n- English/Chinese translation parity and whitespace checks passed."
